4
00:00:04,499 --> 00:00:05,406
Hello!

5
00:00:05,956 --> 00:00:08,839
Today we'll learn three letters.

6
00:00:09,089 --> 00:00:11,045
A, B and C!

7
00:00:12,395 --> 00:00:14,562
This is the letter A.

8
00:00:15,162 --> 00:00:17,198
A! Can you say A?

9
00:00:18,798 --> 00:00:19,463
A!

10
00:00:20,813 --> 00:00:22,932
Apple starts with A.

11
00:00:23,432 --> 00:00:25,227
A, A, apple!

12
00:00:26,577 --> 00:00:28,648
Ant starts with A.

13
00:00:29,148 --> 00:00:30,801
A, A, ant!

14
00:00:32,151 --> 00:00:34,413
This is the letter B.

15
00:00:35,013 --> 00:00:37,291
B! Can you say B?

16
00:00:38,891 --> 00:00:39,678
B!

17
00:00:41,028 --> 00:00:43,099
Ball starts with B.

18
00:00:43,599 --> 00:00:45,434
B, B, ball!

19
00:00:46,784 --> 00:00:49,022
Banana starts with B.

20
00:00:49,522 --> 00:00:51,800
B, B, banana!

21
00:00:53,150 --> 00:00:55,150
Book starts with B.

22
00:00:55,650 --> 00:00:57,525
B, B, book!

23
00:00:58,875 --> 00:01:00,923
Bee starts with B.

24
00:01:01,423 --> 00:01:03,277
B, B, bee!

25
00:01:04,627 --> 00:01:06,842
This is the letter C.

26
00:01:07,442 --> 00:01:09,639
C! Can you say C?

27
00:01:11,239 --> 00:01:11,965
C!

28
00:01:13,315 --> 00:01:15,386
Cat starts with C.

29
00:01:15,886 --> 00:01:17,620
C, C, cat!

30
00:01:18,970 --> 00:01:20,994
Car starts with C.

31
00:01:21,494 --> 00:01:23,208
C, C, car!

32
00:01:24,558 --> 00:01:26,558
Cup starts with C.

33
00:01:27,058 --> 00:01:28,852
C, C, cup!

34
00:01:30,202 --> 00:01:32,202
Cow starts with C.

35
00:01:32,702 --> 00:01:34,315
C, C, cow!

36
00:01:35,665 --> 00:01:38,236
Which letter does ball start with?

37
00:01:40,436 --> 00:01:42,956
B! Ball starts with B!

38
00:01:45,606 --> 00:01:48,035
Which letter does cat start with?

39
00:01:50,235 --> 00:01:52,654
